{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "动画按深度优先顺序访问示例树，并维护从根到当前节点的前缀和。若当前前缀和为 S，只需统计此前出现过多少个 S−8；每次命中就对应一条以当前节点结尾的向下路径。示例中依次找到 5→3、5→2→1 和 −3→11，共 3 条路径。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>路径总和 III 可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.tree{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:10px}\n.level{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,minmax(0,1fr));gap:3px;align-items:stretch}\n.node{min-height:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.node .value,.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}\n.node .name{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;text-align:center;line-height:1.1}\n.node.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.node.current .value{color:#fff}\n.node.path{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;opacity:.85}\n.root{grid-column:4/6}.n5{grid-column:2/4}.nm3{grid-column:6/8}.n3a{grid-column:1/3}.n2{grid-column:3/5}.n11{grid-column:7/9}.n3b{grid-column:1/2}.nm2{grid-column:2/3}.n1{grid-column:4/5}\n.branches{color:#8d8d8d;text-align:center;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px}\n.formula{padding:6px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;background:#2d2d2d;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.formula strong{color:#3794ff}\n.chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin:6px 0 8px}\n.chip{min-width:36px;padding:4px 6px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;text-align:center;font-size:10px}\n.chip .small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.chip.hit{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.stat{flex:1 1 80px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.stat span{display:block;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.stat b{display:block;margin-top:2px;font:600 13px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.stat.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.stat.active b{color:#fff}\n.message{min-height:44px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.message .found{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot{height:3px;flex:1;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px}\n.dot.on{background:#3794ff}\n.legend{margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.tree svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:310px}.tree-edges line{stroke:#9aa1a9;stroke-width:2}.tree .node circle{fill:#2d2d2d;stroke:#626971;stroke-width:1.5}.tree .node text{fill:#eef2f6;font:600 15px \"SF Mono\",monospace;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle}.tree .node.current circle,.tree .node.path circle{fill:#0e639c;stroke:#69b7ff;stroke-width:2.5}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>前缀和沿树向下计数</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">targetSum = <span class=\"mono\">8</span></p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2>示例树</h2>\n<div class=\"tree\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"示例树: 根10, 左子树5, 右子树负3\"><g class=\"tree-edges\"><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"105\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"105\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"180\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"180\"/><line x1=\"430\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"510\" y2=\"180\"/><line x1=\"85\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"35\" y2=\"255\"/><line x1=\"85\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"135\" y2=\"255\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"255\"/></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"a\"><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"30\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"30\">10</text></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"b\"><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"105\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"105\">5</text></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"c\"><circle cx=\"430\" cy=\"105\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"430\" y=\"105\">-3</text></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"d\"><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"180\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"180\">3</text></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"e\"><circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"180\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"180\">2</text></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"f\"><circle cx=\"510\" cy=\"180\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"180\">11</text></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"g\"><circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"255\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"255\">3</text></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"h\"><circle cx=\"135\" cy=\"255\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"135\" y=\"255\">-2</text></g><g class=\"node\" data-id=\"i\"><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"255\" r=\"22\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"255\">1</text></g></svg></div>\n<div class=\"legend\">蓝：当前访问；命中时路径高亮。</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2>搜索状态</h2>\n<div class=\"formula mono\">查找此前的 <strong>S − 8</strong></div>\n<div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div><div id=\"prefixMap\" class=\"formula mono\"></div>\n<div class=\"stats\">\n<div class=\"stat\"><span>前缀和 S</span><b id=\"sum\">0</b></div>\n<div class=\"stat\"><span>需 S−8</span><b id=\"need\">−8</b></div>\n<div class=\"stat\" id=\"countBox\"><span>路径数</span><b id=\"count\">0</b></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"message\" id=\"message\"></div>\n<div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst tree={a:{v:10,kids:['b','c']},b:{v:5,kids:['d','e']},c:{v:-3,kids:['f']},d:{v:3,kids:['g','h']},e:{v:2,kids:['i']},f:{v:11,kids:[]},g:{v:3,kids:[]},h:{v:-2,kids:[]},i:{v:1,kids:[]}};\nconst steps=[],prefix=new Map([[0,1]]),ancestors=[];\nlet count=0;\nfunction snapshot(node,sum,text,paths=[]){\n steps.push({node,sum,need:sum-8,count,text,paths,chain:ancestors.map(x=>[String(tree[x.id].v),x.sum]),map:[...prefix],found:paths.length>0});\n}\nsnapshot(null,0,'初始化空前缀 0 → 1, 这样从根节点开始的路径也能被统计.');\nfunction visit(id,parentSum){\n const sum=parentSum+tree[id].v,need=sum-8;\n const matches=[];\n if(need===0)matches.push([...ancestors.map(x=>x.id),id]);\n ancestors.forEach((x,i)=>{if(x.sum===need)matches.push([...ancestors.slice(i+1).map(y=>y.id),id]);});\n count+=prefix.get(need)||0;\n ancestors.push({id,sum});\n snapshot(id,sum,`访问 ${tree[id].v}: S=${sum}, 先查历史 ${need}, 命中 ${prefix.get(need)||0} 次, 答案=${count}.`,matches);\n prefix.set(sum,(prefix.get(sum)||0)+1);\n snapshot(id,sum,`记录当前前缀 ${sum}, 次数变为 ${prefix.get(sum)}; 再递归左右子树.`);\n tree[id].kids.forEach(child=>visit(child,sum));\n prefix.set(sum,prefix.get(sum)-1);if(prefix.get(sum)===0)prefix.delete(sum);\n ancestors.pop();\n snapshot(id,parentSum,`离开节点 ${tree[id].v}: 撤销前缀 ${sum}, 防止兄弟分支使用它. 当前路径和恢复为 ${parentSum}.`);\n}\nvisit('a',0);\nsnapshot(null,0,`遍历完成: 5 → 3, 5 → 2 → 1, −3 → 11, 共 ${count} 条. 前缀表恢复为 0 → 1.`);\nconst progress=document.getElementById('progress');\nsteps.forEach(()=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='dot';progress.appendChild(d);});\nfunction render(step,index){\n document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(n=>n.classList.remove('current','path'));\n if(step.node)document.querySelector('[data-id=\"'+step.node+'\"]').classList.add('current');\n step.paths.flat().forEach(id=>document.querySelector('[data-id=\"'+id+'\"]').classList.add('path'));\n document.getElementById('chain').innerHTML='<div class=\"chip\">空前缀<span class=\"small\">0</span></div>'+step.chain.map(([v,s])=>'<div class=\"chip\">'+v+'<span class=\"small\">'+s+'</span></div>').join('');\n document.getElementById('prefixMap').textContent='当前路径前缀频次: '+step.map.map(([s,n])=>s+' → '+n).join(', ');\n document.getElementById('sum').textContent=step.sum;document.getElementById('need').textContent=step.need;\n document.getElementById('count').textContent=step.count;document.getElementById('countBox').classList.toggle('active',step.found);\n document.getElementById('message').textContent=step.text;\n document.querySelectorAll('.dot').forEach((d,i)=>d.classList.toggle('on',i===index));\n}\nlet index=0;render(steps[index],index);setInterval(()=>{index=(index+1)%steps.length;render(steps[index],index);},1700);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(h)",
  "complexity_note": "n 是节点数, h 是树高. 时间按哈希查询、更新平均 O(1) 计算; 只保留当前祖先路径的前缀频次, 离开时删除零频次项, 与递归栈共 O(h), 最坏 O(n). 统计条数, 不枚举保存全部路径."
}
